<title>SWEDEN: Foreningsbanken sets $1 bln EMTN loan.</title>
<headline>Foreningsbanken sets $1 bln EMTN loan.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish high-street bank Foreningsbanken on Tuesday posted a seven percent rise in nine month operating profits and announced one billion dollar Euro Medium Term Note programme.</p>
</text>
